WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:09.020
(footsteps)

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:12.430
(magical chimes)

00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:27.740
(rock music)

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:47.500
(footsteps)

00:00:51.753 --> 00:00:56.600
(heavy breathing)

00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:05.950
(rock music)

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:25.010
(breathing)

00:01:25.010 --> 00:01:25.770
- Hey.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:27.430
- Hey.

00:01:27.430 --> 00:01:28.444
- I'm impressed.

00:01:29.124 --> 00:01:29.910
- Thanks.

00:01:30.510 --> 00:01:32.390
- You know, it's hard to start from zero.

00:01:32.930 --> 00:01:33.850
- Yeah.

00:01:37.350 --> 00:01:40.770
Uh, do you wanna maybe
get a smoothie after this.

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:43.190
- Well I have to get to work.

00:01:43.190 --> 00:01:44.763
- Oh yeah, yeah sure.

00:01:44.763 --> 00:01:46.820
- But I play ice hockey
every Thursday night

00:01:46.820 --> 00:01:48.570
at the rec center at eight.

00:01:48.570 --> 00:01:49.480
Do you wanna join?

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:50.740
- Yeah, sure.

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:51.990
- It's an intense workout.

00:01:51.990 --> 00:01:53.080
- Oh yeah, I bet.

00:01:53.830 --> 00:01:54.910
- Yeah?

00:01:55.830 --> 00:01:57.210
- Okay, yeah.

00:01:57.210 --> 00:01:58.080
- Okay.

00:01:58.080 --> 00:01:59.550
Great, I'll see you there.

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:00.282
- Okay.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:04.840
Do I need a helmet?

00:02:04.840 --> 00:02:06.920
Or knee pads?

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:09.800
I don't have knee pads.

00:02:09.800 --> 00:02:14.430
(majestic music)

00:02:15.140 --> 00:02:18.350
(dial-up modem)

